      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A survey of diagnostic details is made on which functional analysis is based. Symptoms connected with the temporo-mandibular joint, muscle palpation, radiological demonstration of the temporo-mandibular joint, and registration of the positional jaw relation are especially dealt with. The methods of examination which are prerequisite to a safe diagnosis are critically evaluated."},
